# One line ending in the repository and in every checkout, whatever the operating system.
# Without this, a Windows checkout turns files to CRLF, and formatting checks, shell
# scripts and tests that read source text fail there (governance assessment, 17 Nov 2026).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
*.xlsx binary
*.docx binary
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
